PATOLOGY AND NUTRITION:La Sociedad Europea de Gastroenterología, Hepatología y Nutrición Pediátricas (ESPGHAN) actualiza recomendaciones sobre la introducción de gluten en la dieta infantil.", "ACADÉMIA AMERICANA DE PEDIATRÍA:The Academia Americana de Pediatría (AAP) is an organization dedicated to pediatric health, providing essential guidelines and recommendations for various aspects of child care. Among its key contributions, the AAP offers advice on the introduction of solid foods for children at high risk of food allergies, ensuring that parents and caregivers are informed about best practices to promote health and safety. Additionally, since 2008, the AAP has also recommended vitamin D supplementation for children, highlighting its importance in maintaining optimal health during early development. Through these initiatives, the AAP plays a crucial role in guiding pediatric care and supporting the well-being of children.", "INHIBIDORES DE LA MONOAMINOXIDASA:Los inhibidores de la monoaminooxidasa (MAO) son medicamentos que pueden interactuar con la dieta baja en histamina y afectar la actividad de DAO.", "DIAMINOXIDASA:La diaminooxidasa (DAO) es una enzima que descompone la histamina en el cuerpo y su actividad puede ser insuficiente en personas con alergias alimentarias.", "DIETA BAJA EN FODMAP:", "SOCIEDAD EUROPEA DE GASTROENTEROLOGÍA, HEPATOLOGÍA Y NUTRICIÓN PEDIÁTRICAS:The European Society of Pediatric Gastroenterology, Hepatology and Nutrition (ESPGHAN) is an organization that updates dietary recommendations for infants, particularly regarding gluten introduction.", "SICHERER:Sicherer is an author known for his work on the epidemiology of food allergies, contributing to the understanding of their prevalence.", "BOYCE:Boyce is an author who has contributed to guidelines for the diagnosis and management of food allergies in the United States.", "MADSEN:Madsen is an author who has provided an overview of the prevalence of food allergies in the medical literature.", "RONA:Rona is an author who has conducted a meta-analysis on the prevalence of food allergies."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}